{"overview":"درست وقتی که پروانهٔ محبوب شاهزاده، ریرین، مورد علاقهٔ اعلیحضرت است، موشک زباله‌دار حسود دربار، کیگِتسو، با جادوی خود بدنشان و سرنوشتشان را عوض می‌کند؛ با نزدیک شدن به اعدام، ریرین بدن سالم جدیدش را می‌پذیرد، در حالی که کیگِتسو می‌فهمد زندگی ریرین آن‌چنان که به نظر می‌رسد نیست و به توطئه‌ای در درون دربار کشیده می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Just as His Highness’s favored butterfly Reirin is beloved by the prince, jealous “court sewer rat” Keigetsu uses magic to swap their bodies—and their destinies. With a looming execution, Reirin embraces her new, healthy body, while Keigetsu learns Reirin’s life isn’t what it seems as she’s pulled into an inner-court conspiracy.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":11,"y":2026,"poster":"/42PzktVKixXyXlZcKWyESpeuXzL.jpg"}],"episodes":11,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"ماناکا ایوامی","role":"Kou Reirin (voice)","photo":"/leKMaCBswXG8u4mfQNQ7J3y6Xow.jpg","en":"Manaka Iwami"},{"name":"川井田夏海","role":"Shu Keigetsu (voice)","photo":"/bdsKRWdB14DAAZzJnRjquWbqNYR.jpg","en":"Natsumi Kawaida"},{"name":"古川慎","role":"Ei Gyoumei (voice)","photo":"/inLmBZhrqXeE9wlViyK28ocKJSw.jpg","en":"Makoto Furukawa"},{"name":"梅原裕一郎","role":"Shin-u (voice)","photo":"/lScrvZi4tKKpk3PbnIjLVjHVNJn.jpg","en":"Yuuichirou Umehara"},{"name":"هانا هیشیکاوا","role":"Leelee (voice)","photo":"/epCzuP9ZmBMonKK2Z6FOKoq2b7k.jpg","en":"Hana Hishikawa"},{"name":"ニケライ・ファラナーゼ","role":"Kou Tousetsu (voice)","photo":"/yYv95EVunqEnGfJujuete8MD8ld.jpg","en":"Farahnaz Nikray"},{"name":"五十嵐麗","role":"Kou Kenshū (voice)","photo":"/sqfOHaLVkZu5zcTo5IZ41hxDJvq.jpg","en":"Rei Igarashi"},{"name":"茅野愛衣","role":"Shu Gabi (voice)","photo":"/l8ywp387rfdAS7mOExe3cEZnsk0.jpg","en":"Ai Kayano"},{"name":"مای ناکاهارا","role":"Kin Seika (voice)","photo":"/s8DBmM540SRlRzUplaapMaDo8vV.jpg","en":"Mai Nakahara"},{"name":"水瀬いのり","role":"Ran Hōshun (voice)","photo":"/cqOrQDUbbQLKpujzcK47YqjFdNp.j